<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Investor overview"><div><strong>Commercial now</strong><span>Canadian NHP product with active commerce in Canada and the United States.</span></div><div><strong>Evidence growing</strong><span>A 2026 peer-reviewed hydration review is published and additional research work is underway.</span></div><div><strong>Next stage</strong><span>Marketing, sales, product development, research execution and clinical-development preparation.</span></div></div>

<section class="bhd-page__feature"><div><p class="bhd-page__kicker">The thesis</p><h2>Product → evidence → access → higher-value applications</h2><p>Best Hydrate is designed as more than a single flavour or sales channel. The operating thesis is to use commercial learning, hydration science, product development and partnerships to reinforce one another, while requiring stronger evidence before stronger medical or clinical claims are made.</p></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Platform</p><h2>Four hydration tracks, one evidence discipline</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>Performance</h3><p>Athletes, heat, sweat, endurance and recovery contexts.</p></article><article><h3>Daily</h3><p>Everyday hydration, work, travel and active-living contexts.</p></article><article><h3>Medical</h3><p>Clinical-development questions that must earn appropriate evidence and regulatory pathways.</p></article><article><h3>Humanitarian</h3><p>Access and implementation opportunities built with appropriate partners and safeguards.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__split"><div class="bhd-page__split-media"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3183150/pexels-photo-3183150.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1500" alt="Business team discussing charts and next-stage priorities" width="1500" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="bhd-page__split-copy"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">What exists today</p><h2>Start from proof, not projections</h2><ul><li>Best Hydrate Inc., founded in Alberta in 2021</li><li>Current Canadian Natural Health Product authorization, NPN 80118664</li><li>Commercial consumer hydration product available in Canada and the U.S.</li><li>2026 peer-reviewed Frontiers in Nutrition hydration review with Best Hydrate affiliation</li><li>Additional research work underway</li><li>Broader product and clinical-development pipeline in progress</li></ul><p>Future channels, research outcomes and clinical applications remain development opportunities, not guaranteed outcomes.</p></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__cards-section"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">What a modest seed can unlock</p><h2>Fund the next proof points</h2><div class="bhd-page__cards bhd-page__cards--4"><article><h3>Marketing leadership</h3><p>Strengthen positioning, demand generation and disciplined commercial execution.</p></article><article><h3>Sales & distribution</h3><p>Improve customer acquisition, channel development and repeatable growth.</p></article><article><h3>Research & pipeline</h3><p>Advance study execution and the next product-development priorities.</p></article><article><h3>Clinical readiness</h3><p>Build the evidence, partnerships and preparation needed for future clinical-development work.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="bhd-page__prose-grid"><article class="bhd-page__prose"><p class="bhd-page__kicker">Capital strategy</p><h2>Lead first, cohort second</h2><p>Best Hydrate is interested in finding the right prospective lead investor or capital partner before assembling a broader follow-on cohort. The objective is a thoughtful structure and useful relationships, not simply maximizing the amount raised.</p><p>Advisors and connectors are welcome even when they are not investors themselves.</p></article><aside class="bhd-page__callout"><span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Next step</span><h3>Help us make the plan stronger.</h3><p>Advice, introductions and expressions of investor interest can all start through one structured form.</p><a class="bhd-page__button" href="/pages/investor-contact#interest-form">Investor & Advisor Interest</a></aside></section>

